<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Sucursales — LoginPro</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/public/favicon-loginpro.svg" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --bg:#f4f5f7; --surface:#fff; --surface-2:#f9fafb; --border:#e1e4e8;
      --text:#1a1d23; --muted:#6b7280; --navy:#1e2d3d; --teal:#0d7a6b;
      --teal-hover:#0a5f53; --teal-light:#e6f4f1; --red:#dc2626; --red-light:#fee2e2;
      --green:#16a34a; --green-light:#dcfce7; --shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
      --radius:10px; --font:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;
    }
    body { font-family:var(--font); background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; }
    .navbar { background:var(--navy); padding:0 24px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:20px; min-height:52px; position:sticky; top:0; z-index:100; }
    .navbar a { color:#cbd5e0; text-decoration:none; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; padding:4px 2px; border-bottom:2px solid transparent; }
    .navbar a:hover,.navbar a.nav-active { color:#fff; border-bottom-color:#4fd1c5; }
    .navbar .brand img { height:28px; display:block; }
    .navbar .spacer { flex:1; }
    .btn-logout { background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); color:#cbd5e0; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:7px; cursor:pointer; }
    .page { max-width:1040px; margin:0 auto; padding:28px 20px 60px; }
    .page-header { margin-bottom:22px; }
    .page-header h1 { color:var(--navy); font-size:24px; margin-bottom:4px; }
    .page-header p { color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; max-width:760px; }
    .alert { padding:10px 14px; border-radius:var(--radius); margin-bottom:16px; font-weight:700; }
    .alert-success { background:var(--green-light); color:var(--green); }
    .alert-error { background:var(--red-light); color:var(--red); }
    .branch-list { display:grid; gap:16px; }
    .branch-card { background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:14px; box-shadow:var(--shadow); overflow:hidden; }
    .branch-header { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; padding:15px 18px; background:var(--surface-2); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
    .branch-title { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .branch-name { color:var(--navy); font-size:16px; font-weight:800; }
    .count { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; border-radius:999px; padding:3px 9px; background:var(--teal-light); color:var(--teal); font-size:11px; font-weight:800; }
    .actions,.inline-form { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .btn { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; border:0; border-radius:8px; padding:7px 12px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; text-decoration:none; }
    .btn-primary { background:var(--teal); color:#fff; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background:var(--teal-hover); }
    .btn-secondary { background:#fff; color:var(--navy); border:1px solid var(--border); }
    .btn-danger { background:var(--red-light); color:var(--red); border:1px solid #fecaca; }
    .btn-sm { padding:5px 9px; font-size:11px; }
    .edit-panel { display:none; padding:10px 18px; background:var(--teal-light); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); }
    input { min-width:200px; flex:1; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; padding:8px 10px; font:inherit; background:#fff; }
    input:focus { outline:none; border-color:var(--teal); box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(13,122,107,.12); }
    .operations { padding:12px 18px; display:grid; gap:8px; }
    .operation-row { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; padding:10px 12px; border:1px solid #eceff2; border-radius:9px; background:var(--surface-2); }
    .operation-name { font-weight:750; color:var(--navy); }
    .operation-meta { color:var(--muted); font-size:11px; margin-top:2px; }
    .add-operation { padding:4px 18px 16px; }
    .new-branch { margin-top:20px; padding:18px; border:2px dashed var(--border); border-radius:14px; background:var(--surface); }
    .new-branch h2 { font-size:14px; color:var(--navy); margin-bottom:10px; }
    .empty { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; padding:5px 0; }
    .notice { margin:0 0 18px; padding:12px 14px; border:1px solid #bae6fd; background:#f0f9ff; color:#075985; border-radius:10px; font-size:12px; }
    @media(max-width:720px){
      .navbar{flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 14px;gap:10px 14px}.navbar .spacer{display:none}.navbar form{width:100%}.btn-logout{width:100%}
      .page{padding:20px 12px 40px}.branch-header,.operation-row{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.actions{width:100%}.inline-form{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}.inline-form input,.inline-form .btn{width:100%}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="navbar">
  <a class="brand" href="/admin" aria-label="LoginPro"><img src="/public/logo-loginpro.svg" alt="LoginPro" /></a>
  <a href="/admin">Panel</a>
  <a href="/admin/locations" class="nav-active">Sucursales</a>
  <% if (role === 'dev' || (typeof canAccessDispatch !== 'undefined' && canAccessDispatch)) { %><a href="/admin/operaciones">Operaciones / Despacho</a><% } %>
  <% if (role === 'dev') { %><a href="/admin/monitor">Monitor</a><% } %>
  <span class="spacer"></span>
  <form method="post" action="/logout"><button type="submit" class="btn-logout">Cerrar sesión</button></form>
</nav>

<main class="page">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Sucursales</h1>
    <p>Administra desde un solo lugar las sucursales y sus operaciones. La sucursal ya no se clasifica por Reclutamiento o Despacho: el mismo catálogo sirve a ambos módulos.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="notice"><strong>Bogotá incluye Siberia.</strong> Siberia se maneja como zona/operación de la sucursal Bogotá y no como una sucursal independiente.</div>

  <% if (successMsg) { %><div class="alert alert-success"><%= successMsg %></div><% } %>
  <% if (errorMsg) { %><div class="alert alert-error"><%= errorMsg %></div><% } %>

  <section class="branch-list">
    <% if (!cities.length) { %><div class="empty">No hay sucursales registradas.</div><% } %>
    <% for (const city of cities) { %>
      <article class="branch-card">
        <div class="branch-header">
          <div class="branch-title">
            <span class="branch-name"><%= city.name %></span>
            <span class="count"><%= city.operations.length %> operación<%= city.operations.length === 1 ? '' : 'es' %></span>
          </div>
          <div class="actions">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="toggle('edit-branch-<%= city.id %>')">Editar</button>
            <% if (city.operations.length === 0) { %>
              <form method="post" action="/admin/locations/cities/<%= city.id %>/delete" onsubmit="return confirm('¿Eliminar la sucursal <%= city.name %>?')">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger btn-sm">Eliminar</button>
              </form>
            <% } %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="edit-panel" id="edit-branch-<%= city.id %>">
          <form method="post" action="/admin/locations/cities/<%= city.id %>/edit" class="inline-form">
            <input type="text" name="name" value="<%= city.name %>" required placeholder="Nombre de la sucursal" />
            <!-- Compatibilidad transitoria: el backend legacy recibe ambos usos habilitados,
                 pero ya no son una decisión de negocio ni se muestran al usuario. -->
            <input type="hidden" name="usedForRecruitment" value="true" />
            <input type="hidden" name="usedForDispatch" value="true" />
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Guardar</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="toggle('edit-branch-<%= city.id %>')">Cancelar</button>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="operations">
          <% if (!city.operations.length) { %><div class="empty">Sin operaciones configuradas.</div><% } %>
          <% for (const op of city.operations) { %>
            <div class="operation-row">
              <div>
                <div class="operation-name"><%= op.name %></div>
                <div class="operation-meta"><%= op._count?.vacancies || 0 %> configuración<%= (op._count?.vacancies || 0) === 1 ? '' : 'es' %> de reclutamiento asociada<%= (op._count?.vacancies || 0) === 1 ? '' : 's' %></div>
              </div>
              <div class="actions">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="toggle('edit-op-<%= op.id %>')">Renombrar</button>
                <% if ((op._count?.vacancies || 0) === 0) { %>
                  <form method="post" action="/admin/locations/operations/<%= op.id %>/delete" onsubmit="return confirm('¿Eliminar la operación <%= op.name %>?')">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-danger btn-sm">Eliminar</button>
                  </form>
                <% } %>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="edit-panel" id="edit-op-<%= op.id %>">
              <form method="post" action="/admin/locations/operations/<%= op.id %>/edit" class="inline-form">
                <input type="text" name="name" value="<%= op.name %>" required placeholder="Nombre de la operación" />
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Guardar</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="toggle('edit-op-<%= op.id %>')">Cancelar</button>
              </form>
            </div>
          <% } %>
        </div>

        <div class="add-operation">
          <form method="post" action="/admin/locations/cities/<%= city.id %>/operations" class="inline-form">
            <input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="Nueva operación o zona (ej: Siberia)" />
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Agregar operación</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </article>
    <% } %>
  </section>

  <section class="new-branch">
    <h2>Nueva sucursal</h2>
    <form method="post" action="/admin/locations/cities" class="inline-form">
      <input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="Ej: Bogotá, Cali, Barranquilla" />
      <input type="hidden" name="usedForRecruitment" value="true" />
      <input type="hidden" name="usedForDispatch" value="true" />
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Crear sucursal</button>
    </form>
  </section>
</main>
<script>
  function toggle(id) {
    const el = document.getElementById(id);
    if (!el) return;
    el.style.display = el.style.display === 'block' ? 'none' : 'block';
  }
  setTimeout(() => document.querySelectorAll('.alert').forEach((item) => item.remove()), 5000);
</script>
</body>
</html>
